' v1.2's door title in a place another player holds (`AreEntrancesBlockedFor`,
' `newburn?103`; `preset classic ai modern seed 7 start 27`,
' v12_targets_attack's start: Paradise Camp is player 3's). The pointer over
' the tent shows "Blocked" over its middle (`blocked`), not the room's name;
' its door stays shut as before.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' set out for Paradise Camp, two days
wait 30
wait 30
mapclick 110,122         ' in
wait 60
clickon 61               ' up to him, in speak mode
wait 1
esc
wait 5
mapmove 177,150          ' the pointer on the tent
wait 3
snap blocked
quit
